r api module,' and 'X data layer impl module,' and 'X data layer test modul=
e'.  Dashed arrows indicate dependencies or data flow. The 'app module' dep=
ends on the 'X feature module' (indicated by a dashed arrow labeled 'depend=
s on'). The 'X feature module' depends on the 'X data layer api module' (in=
dicated by a downward dashed arrow). The 'app module' also connects to the =
'X data layer impl module' via a downward dashed arrow.  The 'test module' =
is connected to the 'app module' with a horizontal dashed arrow, indicating=
