opriate storage solution based on the specific requirements.</p>
<p>During an interview, walking through this decision tree demonstrates a m=
ethodical approach to storage selection. Rather than simply naming a storag=
e option, you can explain your reasoning at each decision point, showing ho=
w we've considered security needs, data complexity, relationship requiremen=
ts, and access patterns.</p>
